<title>USA: Bell Technology Group Q2 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Bell Technology Group Q2 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended     Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				March 31,		 March 31,</p>
<p>			    1997	1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Revenues	 $5,229,452 $2,342,616  $8,925,851  $4,764,877</p>
<p> Net loss	  (393,202)  (429,498) (1,074,008)   (620,126)</p>
